message: If you use Code Origin Detector in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: Code Origin Detector
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2025-09-20
abstract: >
  Code Origin Detector is a research-grade toolkit that combines heuristics, stylometry,
  and machine learning models to estimate whether source code was authored by humans or AI systems.
repository-code: https://github.com/code-origin-detector/code-origin-detector
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: Code Origin Detector Team
contact:
  - email: research@code-origin-detector.org
keywords:
  - code-authorship
  - ai-detection
  - stylometry
  - machine-learning
